<title>USA: C. Brewer Homes chief executive leaves.</title>
<headline>C. Brewer Homes chief executive leaves.</headline>
<dateline>WAILUKU, Hawaii 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>C. Brewer Homes Inc on Friday said its president and chief executive officer, Pete Moynahan, was leaving the company to form a real estate development and management-consulting firm.</p>
<p>The board named J. W. A. Buyers, the company's chairman, to serve as acting chief executive officer until a replacement could be named.</p>
<p>As of January 1, Edward Foley, a senior vice president of C. Brewer Homes, will become executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
